      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-shield-yao-owner-hero-1181",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**孙膑：** 通过频繁施法给曜永久成长，优先觉醒，前期合成与快速技能共同提高等级。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1Gsan6bECH:p1",
          "start": 97.66,
          "end": 166.87
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-shield-yao-owner-hero-1081",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**墨子：** 整备积累生命上限，较早觉醒有利于后期生存与炸盾伤害；不把其普通攻击输出当作此位置主要目的。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1Gsan6bECH:p1",
          "start": 310.44,
          "end": 367.56
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-shield-yao-owner-hero-1211",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**芈月：** 打效果牌时补逐鹿成长，是多种成长渠道之一，觉醒优先级低于西施等启动组件；不为追其觉醒与高阶逐鹿同行无条件争牌。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1Gsan6bECH:p1",
          "start": 310.44,
          "end": 367.56
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-shield-yao-owner-hero-1191",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**扁鹊：** 破盾输出的关键，护盾被击破有冷却限制，连续叠盾不能无视冷却无限爆炸。补首张启动炸盾，再按进度补觉醒提升伤害。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1Gsan6bECH:p1",
